# `browsers/` is where install.sh puts Chromium on the Ubuntu path. In
# the image it lives at PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=/opt/browsers instead,
# and a host copy travelling in the build context would be a few hundred
# MB of the wrong platform's binaries sitting at /app/browsers.
browsers/

# Live credentials, all three. cameras.json holds backend/LiveKit
# settings, inventory.json each camera's device key and admin password,
# identity.json this instance's bearer token. They are gitignored for
# the same reason and must never be baked into an image that gets
# pushed to a registry — the container reads them from the volume and
# the environment.
cameras.json
inventory.json
identity.json

.venv/
.git/
logs/*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.zip
